政何有？","attribution":"张璠《汉纪》","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":28,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-2c3e73d9e07dc5ae3b20","start":25,"end":91},{"id":"zhouyu-f0005-q","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-c0e659dc356b6d97b476","layer":"pei","quote":"景字仲嚮","attribution":"谢承《后汉书》","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":27,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-2c3e73d9e07dc5ae3b20","start":13,"end":17},{"id":"zhouyu-f0011-q","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-7e5b67e8fe855e34c562","layer":"original","quote":"景子忠〖3〗，皆为汉太尉。","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":23,"end":36},{"id":"zhouyu-q-o001","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-7e5b67e8fe855e34c562","layer":"original","quote":"周瑜字公瑾，庐江舒人也〖1〗。从祖父景〖2〗，景子忠〖3〗，皆为汉太尉。﹝一﹞父异，洛阳令。","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":46},{"id":"zhouyu-q-p001","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-c0e659dc356b6d97b476","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞谢承《后汉书》曰：“景字仲嚮。少以廉能见称。以明学察孝廉，辟公府。后为豫州刺史，辟汝南陈蕃为别驾，颍川李膺、荀绲、杜密、沛国朱寓为从事：皆天下英俊之士也。稍迁至尚书令，遂登太尉。”","attribution":"谢承《后汉书》","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":27,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-2c3e73d9e07dc5ae3b20","start":0,"end":93},{"id":"zhouyu-q-p002","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-22de006a7efb0535aa0f","layer":"pei","quote":"张璠《汉纪》曰：“景〔祖〕父荣，章、和世为尚书令。初景历位牧守，好善爱士。每岁举孝廉，延请入，上后堂，与家人宴会。如此者数四。及赠送既备，又选用其子弟，常称曰：‘移臣作子，于政何有？’先是，司徒韩�为河内太守，在公无私；所举，一辞而已，后亦不及其门户，曰：‘我举若可矣，不令恩偏（称）〔积〕一家也。’当时论者，或两讥焉。”","attribution":"张璠《汉纪》","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":28,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-2c3e73d9e07dc5ae3b20","start":0,"end":161}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
